Organization = {Tianjin Univ Commerce},
Abstract = {The coordinative development between urban land use structure and
   industrial structure is viewed as the necessary factor to realize urban
   sustainable development. Using coupling degree model, this paper
   analyzes the coupling features of urban land use structure and
   industrial structure. The results indicate that: ( 1) The coupling
   degree between urban land use structure and industrial structure has
   been gradually increasing, but since 2002, the coupling degree took on
   weak inverse ``U{''} shape, the coupling degree was on decreasing trend:
   ( 2) The coupling degree of 29 provincial capital cities were in the
   range of 0.3739 similar to 0.5065 in 2007, which belonged to moderate
   coupling and low coupling, and the coupling degree was mainly moderate:
   (3) The deviation coefficient of urban land use structure and industrial
   structure variation ratio decreased from 2.92 to 0.90 during 1991
   similar to 2007, this showed the synchronous change trend between urban
   land use structure and industrial structure.},
