   AND ENVIRONMENT-FRIENDLY SOCIETY},
Year = {2009},
Pages = {224-228},
Note = {International Symposium on Sustainable-Development-of-City-Group,
   Changsha, PEOPLES R CHINA, NOV 16, 2009},
Organization = {Sustainable Dev City Grp; Cent S Univ, Hunan Inst Syst Engn \&
   Management},
Abstract = {This paper makes deep study on the issues of the coordinated development
   of urbanization and eco-environment. We first build the evaluation index
   system of urbanization and eco-environmental development level,then we
   use the combination of subjective and objective method to determine the
   weight of each index in urbanization and eco-environment,and make
   calculations of the 16 cities' urbanization and eco-environmental
   development level on the Changjiang River Delta city group. We calculate
   the degree of coordinated development of the 16 cities' urbanization and
   eco-environmental development according to Coordinated Development Model
   and divide 16 cities into four kinds of development type based on the
   measurement results. We also analyze each type of urban development and
   summarize the final evaluation results.},
