   Div Water Sci; WHO UNEP Global Environm Monitoring Syst; Severn Trent
   Water; Entec Europe Ltd; NIREX UK Ltd; Environm Agcy},
Abstract = {In the context of sustainable development, there is a need to promulgate
   guidelines for urban planning which will consider the effects of the
   built environment on water resources. Our current work is a first step
   on the way towards Water-Sensitive Urban Planning (WSUP). It focuses on
   groundwater protection, and includes: a review of the state of knowledge
   regarding the effect of urban development on runoff and infiltration,
   assessment of these effects for the coastal. aquifer in Israel,
   identification of relevant components of WSUP, preliminary practical
   proposals, and recommendations for further research.},
