Abstract = {Supported by extensive statistical survey data, this paper provides an
   analysis of urban transportation and air pollution mitigation in Xiamen
   city of China. The objective of this paper is to review problems of
   transportation congestion and air pollution in Xiamen, analyze policies
   that have already been adopted by the Xiamen Municipal government to
   improve transportation conditions and air quality, and recommend further
   policies to improve Xiamen's transportation and environment. This paper
   concludes that the future development of transportation in Xiamen should
   emphasize public mass transportation rather than private cars.},
