   Yangtze Three Gorges Project Dev Corp; China Natl Nucl Corp; BMW Grp
   Beijing; Chun Wo Construct \& Engn Co Ltd; Shui On Land Ltd; Air China},
Abstract = {Based on the long - term practice of ``river rehabilitation from
   ecological perspective{''}, the ecological treatment technology system
   for urban rivers is discussed, then the application of ecological
   treatment technologies in Shanghai's urban rivers is introduced.
   Firstly, it is presented that ecological treatment technologies for
   urban rivers can be broadly classifies as three categories: receiving
   pollution sources treatment technologies, including interception and
   treatment of river exterior pollution sources, dredging and disposal of
   river interior pollution sources;, in - situ river purification
   technologies, including river water quality purification and river
   ecology restoration; river ecological hydraulics technologies, including
   comprehensive water diversion and local flow field control. Secondly,
   ecological treatment achievements in Suzhou Creek of Shanghai is
   introduced, the studying ecological treatment technologies combing
   Chinese ``863{''} high - tech research{''} development and application
   of technologies for water environment amelioration of Shanghai{''} is
   also introduced.},
