   System Science, Henan Polytechn Univ, Jiaozuo, PEOPLES R CHINA, MAY
   15-17, 2008},
Abstract = {Artificial Life is the simulation, extension and expansion of natural
   life. As a kind of software Artificial Life, SoftMan is the virtual
   robot living and acting in computer network world. It has a humanized
   structure and simulating human, and its perception system should be able
   to recognize perceptive objects. A cooperative classification model for
   SoftMan's perception system has been proposed, in which, different
   humanized senses are simulated by multiple classifier systems (MCS). An
   essential issue in the research of MCS is the method of multiple
   classifier fusion. Accordingly, this paper proposes a method of multiple
   classifier fusion based on decision profile. Simulated experiments were
   done to compare the method with the Decision Templates (DT) method. The
   experimental results show the presented method is effective.},
