   Degree in China},
Booktitle = {DYNAMICS OF URBAN AGGLOMERATION IN CHINA: PREFERENCES OF ENERGY-SAVING
   AND ENVIRONMENT-FRIENDLY SOCIETY},
Year = {2009},
Pages = {465-469},
Note = {International Symposium on Sustainable-Development-of-City-Group,
   Changsha, PEOPLES R CHINA, NOV 16, 2009},
Organization = {Sustainable Dev City Grp; Cent S Univ, Hunan Inst Syst Engn \&
   Management},
Abstract = {Industry environment friendly is the most important factor of
   constructing resource conservation and environmentally friendly society.
   Based on the data from Chinese Statistical Yearbook and Chinese
   Environment Yearbook in 2007 in 30 provinces, autonomous regions, and
   metropolis in China, 13 indexes were chosen to evaluate the environment
   friendly degree, and factor analysis method was employed to study the
   difference of environment friendly among the provinces. The results
   showed that there existed significant regional difference about industry
   environment friendly. It presented tendency of decreasing progressively
   in turn from eastern part, middle part to western part in China and had
   some relevance with the industrialization advancement. The results also
   demonstrated the crucial reason resulting in industry environmental
   problem was extensive industry growth way instead of industry
   development itself.},
