Year = {2011},
Pages = {491-497},
Note = {International Conference on Strategic Management (ICSM 2011), Phuket,
   THAILAND, DEC 21-23, 2011},
Abstract = {As an important part of urban economy, the housing market has a close
   relationship with urban economy system. The changes of housing price
   will affect people's living costs and further affect the labor cost,
   which produce the cost effect to the urban economy. This paper starts
   from the development situation of China's urban economy and housing
   market, trying to analyze the interaction influence between them, and
   then points out the conduction path of housing market and urban economy
   by five figures. At last, according to the current situation in China,
   this paper proposes countermeasures of Chinese housing market from the
   angles of quantity and structure. The findings are as follows
   :(1)housing price can influence the urban economy through the effect of
   consumption, investment and labor costs; (2) the urban economy can
   affect the housing price by the city cycle, the income level of
   residents and investment.},
