Note = {2nd International Conference on Civil, Architectural and Hydraulic
   Engineering (ICCAHE 2013), Zhuhai, PEOPLES R CHINA, JUL 27-28, 2013},
Abstract = {This paper is about the spacial development characteristics of Jiangyin
   city under the background of urban-rural integration. Through the
