Abstract = {Firstly, the paper discusses the green logistics of urban agglomeration
   in the view of low carbon economy, and constructs the green logistics
   system of chang-zhu-tan urban agglomeration in China. Secondly,
   combining the regional logistics characteristics of chang-zhu-tan urban
   agglomeration, the research constructs the green logistics evaluation
   index system of chang-zhu-tan urban agglomeration. Finally, by using the
   Fuzzy-AHP model, the study evaluates the green degree of logistics
   development of chang-zhu-tan urban agglomeration. The results shows that
   the overall level of green logistics in chang-zhu-tan urban
   agglomeration is good, but in the aspects of intensive and environmental
   protection still requires huge investment and improvement.},
