   Engineering (ICCAHE 2013), Zhuhai, PEOPLES R CHINA, JUL 27-28, 2013},
Abstract = {The Paper discusses the experiences of Singapore in city image building
   under the guidance of urban planning. By making use of such methods as
   documentary study and on-the-sport survey and starting from an angle of
   city image association, three elements for city image building are
   established and, based on those, the strategies of Singapore in city
   image building are touched on, mainly reflecting in following aspects:
   1) with regard to city image mind identity, Singapore has undergone a
   transition from `Instant Asia' to `Your Singapore'; 2) with respect to
   city image behavior identity, citizens, enterprises and government are
   encouraged to jointly participate in marketing city image and 3) as for
   city image visual identity, it has strengthened heritage protection,
   built the brand of cultural entertainment, planned and modeled city
   image by taking culture as guidance.},
