Abstract = {City is the space carrier of humans and matters that are in dynamic
   changing. Taking mankind as its center, urban community safety plan is a
   complex which combines the natural, social and economic elements. It is
   a unified entirety with certain structure and function. Firstly, ArcIMS
   data frame and the technology of digital and visual were used to express
   the city space entity information with space set, attribute set and
   index set. The problems including knowledge base, chart base, and the
   technical plan of program database of urban community safety plan were
   also solved. Then ArcIMS map data organization toot was used to mark the
   geographic coordinate in the space chart, and a corresponding chart
   ({*}. shp) file was produced. These files were the objects that expert
   system of urban community safety plan would promulgate and operate.
   Finally, combining with the planning and decision function of expert
   system of urban community safety plan, and taking a friendly user
   interface and man-machine conversation process as assistant, ArcIMS map
   service management tool was used to realize the data share,
   intercommunication, and coordination of each subsystem in the operation
   environment of general control module. And a software of expert system
   of urban community safety plan was compiled to provide a valid assistant
   means for urban community safety plan, emergency management and the
   accident rescues work.},
