   Conf Comm},
Abstract = {Urban Tourism is an important field of tourism study, and urban tourism
   industry is an important part in the development of tourism industry in
   China. At present, there is a phenomenon of blind expansion in China's
   urban tourism development in some cities, which want to expand tourism
   industry input (such as a large number of five-star hotels were
   constructed) to obtain more tourism output (income). It is a valuable
   deep discussion that measuring whether the proportion relationship
   between the urban tourism input and output is reasonable or not.
   Therefore, this paper use the DEA model to evaluate tourism input-output
   efficiency of 15 vice-provincial cities in China, in the process, the
   concept of correction coefficient was introduced to correct the error,
   which was caused by the different development environment in different
   regions. Finally, make a comparative analysis on the comprehensive
   efficiency, technical efficiency and scale efficiency of the 15
   vice-provincial cities, at the same time, and put forward the
   corresponding strategy for the future development.},
